    <div class="eyebrow">Sources</div>
    <h1>Where the information comes from</h1>
    <p>Official Mexican institutions are used for the numbers. Newsrooms and research groups are used for reporting and context. Figures link to the original source where they appear on the site.</p>
  </header>

